OL,3,GNEWSAWeekly park trips 'boost
OL,4,Achildren's mental health'
OL,5,
OL,6,FChildren who visit a park at least once
OL,7,Fa week may have better mental health as
OL,8,Fthey grow up, a study says.
OL,10,FExperts at the University of Exeter
OL,11,Fsaid they had analysed data from 4,219
OL,12,Fyoungsters aged between four and 11
OL,13,Ftaking part in the Children of the 90s
OL,14,FStudy.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
