OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSAWeekly park trips 'boost
OL,4,Achildren's mental health'
OL,5,
OL,6,FSocial-emotional development was
OL,7,Fmeasured using questionnaires completed
OL,8,Fby parents at five points in their
OL,9,Fchild's life and the study found
OL,10,Fchildren who were taken to the park at
OL,11,Fleast once a week had better
OL,12,Fsocial-emotional development compared
OL,13,Fto those who went less often,
OL,14,Fresearchers said.
OL,16,FCommunities needed "good quality parks
OL,17,Fthat are safe, accessible and welcoming
OL,18,Fto families from all backgrounds", they
OL,19,Fadded.
